answer: It is a rectangle, because a square has all four sides equal, while a rectangle only has its opposite sides equal.

[p3] (practice)
State one difference between a parallelogram and a trapezium.
answer: A parallelogram has two pairs of parallel sides, while a trapezium has only one pair of parallel sides.

[p4] (practice)
A nonagon has how many sides, and into how many triangles can it be divided?
answer: 9 sides; 7 triangles (9 − 2 = 7).
